  "changes": [
    "A separate native image retains the qualified vector decoder, TS planes, F32 BF16-representable input contract, ordered one-chain low[j]/high[j+8] FMA, exact XOR tree, symbols/ABI and16rows-per-CTA/256threads launch geometry.",
