    "Two-phase unroll is a scheduling hypothesis: reduce replicated instruction body while retaining limited adjacent-phase load scheduling; no measured benefit is claimed before actual GPU timing.",
    "New source/build/provenance only; existing qualified native files, wrappers, engine policies, defaults and GGML dependencies are untouched."
  ],
